table.insert(CHANGELOG, 1, {
    v = "1.8",
    date = "Nov 3, 2026",
    title = "Card Pick and Go To Lobby",
    items = {
        {
            "🏠",
            "Go To Lobby",
            "Two new buttons on the Settings → General. Go To Lobby leaves the match at once, and the farm starts no other match until you press Start Farming Again. Summons, fuses and stars you switched on keep running in the lobby. A match that was already starting when you pressed it comes straight back.",
            "NEW"
        },
        {
            "🃏",
            "Card Pick for the Summer Hunt",
            "Choose how the farm takes the Hunt's cards, on the Farm → Stages. Secret Luck (the default) takes the card with the most secret luck, then the most pay. Gems takes the card that pays the most. Easiest Win takes the one that makes your team strongest. Smart weighs pay against strength, as before. Except on Easiest Win, a card that would leave your team too weak to win is never taken.",
            "NEW"
        },
        {
            "🏺",
            "Artifact Stage",
            "The Artifact Stage (a new one every 14 days) is played now, alone, ahead of other kinds while your team has a chance there, until its 10 clears are in: 30 gems a clear, and at 3, 5 and 10 clears 15 Limited Star Remnants and 250 gems in all, claimed for you. The simulator reads its enemies 2.1× tougher, as the stage says, until real runs measure them. Losses rest it like any mode. Farm → Stages: Off, On or Only this.",
            "NEW"
        },
        {
            "🧟",
            "Zombie (Risen)'s blessing",
            "Every summon on the map does +25% damage and reaches 10% further for each Zombie (Risen) placed, ×2 with all 4 down. The simulator now plays it on Iron Sentinel's drones and Elyssia's jellyfish and eels, and on the dead enemies Violentine (Brutal Angel) raises once a run has measured how much of hers they deal (the DAMAGE line now says what each unit's summons dealt), and both it and the match value another Zombie by a quarter of what your summons deal, measured live from their real damage. So the team search can pick it next to your summoners, and a match places all 4 when your summons are worth it.",
            "NEW"
        },


        {
            "🔥",
            "Fuse For XP uses everything unlocked",
