        {
            "🚪",
            "Violentine at the entrance",
            "Violentine (Brutal Angel) raises the last enemy she hit when it dies, so she now stands at the road's entrance, where enemies come before your other units reach them, the spot a unit in takedown training gets. Her raised enemies take Zombie (Risen)'s blessing too.",
            "IMPROVED"
        },
        {
            "🧩",
            "Team search on a new account",
            "The team search leaves out units under level 50, so a weak unit doesn't take a slot. On a new account every unit is under 50, so the search had nothing to pick from and kept whatever team you set. That rule now waits until you own 6 kinds of attacker at level 50 or more. Before that, the search picks your best units at any level, and the farm equips what it finds.",
            "FIX"
        },
        {
            "🏖️",
            "The Summer Hunt for new teams",
            "A team that can't win the Hunt yet no longer replays it over and over. What only a win pays (a new bingo square, a new weather, the first Explosion Mage) now counts at the real chance of winning, where it used to count on every run, lost ones too. The pearls still count in full, as they come on a loss too.",
