            "FIX"
        },
        {
            "💾",
            "Your farm's memory is safer",
            "A copy of brain.json is kept every 10 minutes. If the game closes while saving and the file can't be read, the copy is loaded instead of starting over (the broken file is kept as brain.corrupt.json). Numbers JSON can't hold no longer break a save.",
            "FIX"
        },
        {
            "🧾",
            "Logs no longer grow forever",
            "log.txt and planner.log move to .old at 2 MB, and planner lines are written together every few seconds instead of one file write each.",
            "IMPROVED"
        },
        {
            "🧹",
            "Readable code",
            "About 7,600 leftover names like Bxc and qd now say what they hold. The compiled code is byte-for-byte the same as before for that step.",
            "IMPROVED"
        }
    }
})
